                        "review": "Alright.. that's it.. I finnaly finished this puzzle jumper. \n\nQuite a bit harder then expect not because the level design but because of hand eye coordination.\nIF you have a single track mind that can only focus on one task you will have a lot trouble with this game.\n\nBetween jumpping/double jumping/landing/change platform color it will need your mind to do basic yet awekward multitask thinking. For the little action you do.. it's just got too much things happening at once.\n\nI have quite a bit problem at first then i gotr my friend to help me. \nOne of us jumping, the other switch platform color. We were able to finish the rest of the level pretty quick.\n\nSome achivements are quite hard to do but there are some really easy achivements that you can get easily so you don't ruin your completion ratio too much if you give up on this game. (like dying or clearing your own level achivements are easy!)\n\ngraphics is very basic but physics of the balls is very well done. the lighting and sound effect are also pretty nice.\n\n7.0/10.. only recommended for multitask puzzle solver and thinker.",
